{"title":"Odric the Knifeward","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Odric the Knifeward is a named <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> seen at level 11 (warrior).</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Iron Spikedhelm</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Iron Dagger</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Odric the Knifeward</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-172\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"odric-the-knifeward\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for Odric the Knifeward yet.</p>\n      <h2>Other named Skeletons</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/the-bell-ringer\">The Bell-Ringer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/skeleton-king\">Skeleton King</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/royal-guard\">Royal Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/king-jordon\">King Jordon</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/dccf3ddb0a2cb417e0d2.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Odric the Knifeward</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>warrior</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>34</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}